<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Balloon Archery '95</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Press+Start+2P&family=VT323&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
  html,body { width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden; background:#000; }
  body { font-family:'VT323', monospace; }
  #wrap { position:relative; width:100vw; height:100vh; }
  canvas { display:block; width:100%; height:100%; cursor:crosshair; image-rendering:pixelated; }
  .overlay {
    position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center; justify-content:center; text-align:center;
    background:rgba(0,0,20,0.72); color:#fff; z-index:5;
  }
  .hidden { display:none; }
  h1 { font-family:'Press Start 2P', monospace; font-size:clamp(20px,4.5vw,44px);
       color:#ffd23f; text-shadow:4px 4px 0 #b34700, 8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.5);
       margin-bottom:28px; line-height:1.4; }
  .sub { font-size:clamp(18px,2.6vw,30px); color:#bfe8ff; margin-bottom:34px; line-height:1.5; }
  .btn {
    font-family:'Press Start 2P', monospace; font-size:clamp(12px,1.8vw,18px);
    color:#fff; background:#2e7d32; border:4px solid #a5d6a7;
    padding:18px 34px; cursor:pointer; box-shadow:0 6px 0 #1b5e20;
    transition:transform .05s;
  }
  .btn:hover { background:#388e3c; }
  .btn:active { transform:translateY(4px); box-shadow:0 2px 0 #1b5e20; }
  #finalScore { font-size:clamp(22px,3.4vw,40px); color:#ffd23f; margin-bottom:30px; }
  .tip { position:absolute; bottom:14px; width:100%; text-align:center;
         color:rgba(255,255,255,.55); font-size:18px; pointer-events:none; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="wrap">
  <canvas id="cv"></canvas>

  <div id="startScreen" class="overlay">
    <h1>BALLOON<br>ARCHERY '95</h1>
    <div class="sub">
      Aim with the mouse &mdash; hold &amp; drag back to draw the bow.<br>
      Release to fire. Pop balloons. Don't let 5 escape!<br>
      (or press SPACE / click START)
    </div>
    <button class="btn" id="startBtn">START</button>
  </div>

  <div id="endScreen" class="overlay hidden">
    <h1>GAME OVER</h1>
    <div id="finalScore">SCORE 0</div>
    <button class="btn" id="retryBtn">PLAY AGAIN</button>
  </div>
</div>

